From: Gregory Bryant <gregory.r.bryant@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:18:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Add experimental arch 14 firmware write
 (--write-arch14-fw)

Writes a raw Region 2 image to external flash at 0x0 on Harmony 650/700,
then verifies it by reading back. The image's size, 0x4847 marker, entry
goto and header checksum are checked first, and the remote must be in
application or safe mode. Without --commit only the checks run.

Adds CRemote::EraseSector because EraseFlash never erases the sector at
flash_base (it starts from the first boundary in the sector table).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EuLqkrUHyeLdQZcZbCMFB3
